graph TB
    subgraph Orchestrator["FMS Guardrails Orchestrator (Rust/axum+tokio)"]
        direction TB
        GuardrailsServer["Guardrails Server<br/>Port 8033/TCP<br/>HTTP/HTTPS"]
        HealthServer["Health Server<br/>Port 8034/TCP<br/>HTTP"]
        DetectorClient["Detector Client<br/>HTTP Client"]
        ChunkerClient["Chunker Client<br/>gRPC Client"]
        GenerationClient["Generation Client<br/>gRPC Client"]
        OpenAIClient["OpenAI Client<br/>HTTP Client"]
        DetectionBatcher["Detection Batcher<br/>Orders & batches results"]

        GuardrailsServer -->|dispatches tasks| DetectorClient
        GuardrailsServer -->|dispatches tasks| ChunkerClient
        GuardrailsServer -->|dispatches tasks| GenerationClient
        GuardrailsServer -->|dispatches tasks| OpenAIClient
        DetectorClient -->|feeds results| DetectionBatcher
        DetectionBatcher -->|ordered results| GuardrailsServer
    end

    Client[External Client] -->|POST /api/v1/* /api/v2/*<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS| GuardrailsServer
    HealthProbe[Health Probe] -->|GET /health /info<br/>8034/TCP HTTP| HealthServer

    DetectorClient -->|POST /api/v1/text/*<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>TLS configurable| DetectorServices["Detector Services<br/>(HAP, Toxicity, PII)"]

    ChunkerClient -->|gRPC ChunkersService<br/>8085/TCP<br/>TLS/mTLS configurable| ChunkerServices["Chunker Services<br/>(Caikit Runtime)"]

    GenerationClient -->|gRPC GenerationService<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS/mTLS configurable| TGIS["TGIS<br/>(Text Generation)"]
    GenerationClient -->|gRPC NlpService<br/>8085/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS/mTLS configurable| CaikitNLP["Caikit NLP"]

    OpenAIClient -->|POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>TLS configurable| OpenAILLM["OpenAI-compatible LLM<br/>(e.g., vLLM)"]

    Orchestrator -.->|OTLP export<br/>4317/TCP gRPC or 4318/TCP HTTP| OTLPCollector["OTLP Collector"]

    style GuardrailsServer fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style HealthServer fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style DetectorClient fill:#5ba0d2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ChunkerClient fill:#5ba0d2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style GenerationClient fill:#5ba0d2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style OpenAIClient fill:#5ba0d2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style DetectionBatcher fill:#5ba0d2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style DetectorServices fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style ChunkerServices fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style TGIS fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style CaikitNLP fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style OpenAILLM fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style OTLPCollector fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Client fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#999
    style HealthProbe fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#999
